OL,3,AAI giant Anthropic unveils plans for
OL,4,Ablockbuster share listing
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) firm
OL,7,FAnthropic has revealed details of its
OL,8,Fbusiness ahead of its plans to sell
OL,9,Fshares to the public in what will
OL,10,Flikely be the largest stock market
OL,11,Fdebut in history.
OL,13,FThe company behind AI chatbot Claude
OL,14,Frevealed losses of more than $80.7bn
OL,15,F(#60.5bn) in the first half of the
OL,16,Fyear. It said it generated revenue of
OL,17,F$16.3bn over the same period.
OL,19,FThe number of shares to be released and
OL,20,Ftheir price range is yet to be
OL,21,Fdetermined.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
