OL,3,AAI giant Anthropic unveils plans for
OL,4,Ablockbuster share listing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic's valuation when it goes
OL,7,Fpublic has been expected to exceed that
OL,8,Fof SpaceX, which this summer was the
OL,9,Fbiggest-ever stock listing at an
OL,10,Finitial valuation of about $1.8
OL,11,Ftrillion.
